WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.520
Hello.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.000
Here you go.
-Thank you.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.760
On my schoolboy's copy books

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.720
On my desk and the trees

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.640
On the sand on the snow

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.280
I write your name

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.800
On all pages read
On all blank pages

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:20.280
Stone blood paper or ash
I write your name

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.840
On the wonder of the nights
On the white bread of the days

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.080
On seasons betrothed
I write your name

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.360
On the foam of clouds
On the sweat of the storm

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:31.000
On the dense and insipid rain
I write your name

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.760
On my ravaged shelters
On my collapsed lighthouses

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.640
On the walls of my ennui
I write your name

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:39.560
And by the power of one word
I start again my life

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.640
I was born to know you
To name you

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.120
Liberty.

